<div class="suntneew-purchase-panel" aria-label="Payment and purchase support">
  {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="suntneew-purchase-panel__payments">
      <p>Pay securely with</p>

      <ul role="list" aria-label="Accepted payment methods">
        {%- for payment_type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          <li title="{{ payment_type | replace: '_', ' ' | capitalize }}">
            {{- payment_type | payment_type_svg_tag -}}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="suntneew-purchase-panel__assurances">
    <details>
      <summary>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3 20 6v5c0 5-3.4 8.5-8 10-4.6-1.5-8-5-8-10V6z"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong>Model-Matched Warranty</strong>
          <small>Coverage and documents follow the exact product model.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <p>Check the model page and documentation before relying on a warranty term. <a href="/pages/contact-us">Ask support</a> if you need confirmation.</p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h16v12H4z"/><path d="m4 10 8 4 8-4M8 5h8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong>14-Day Returns</strong>
          <small>Request an eligible return within 14 days after delivery.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <p>Returns require prior approval and the correct warehouse instructions. <a href="/pages/return-policy">Read the return policy</a>.</p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h11v10H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong>U.S. Warehouse Delivery</strong>
          <small>Eligible stocked products ship domestically for faster delivery.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <p>Delivery timing depends on stock, destination, carrier and product restrictions. <a href="/pages/shipping-policy">Review shipping details</a>.</p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3v18"/><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong>Free U.S. Shipping</strong>
          <small>Free standard shipping on eligible contiguous-U.S. orders.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <p>Some destinations, oversized items or special delivery services can have different terms. <a href="/pages/shipping-policy">See eligibility</a>.</p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <strong>Product Support</strong>
          <small>Ask fit, setup or product questions before or after purchase.</small>
        </span>
        <span class="suntneew-purchase-panel__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <p>Send the model name and your use case so the support team can give a more precise answer. <a href="/pages/contact-us">Contact support</a>.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
